+"""Tests for Exp6198 V537 post-marker source and roadmap-scope audit.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-INFRA-6198, SCENARIO-INFRA-6198-1,
+SCENARIO-INFRA-6198-2, SCENARIO-INFRA-6198-3,
+SCENARIO-INFRA-6198-4, SCENARIO-INFRA-6198-5.
+"""
